    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>
/* PC: Onesie
OC Leo: PJs, */

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You look great.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span> laughs, walking over and patting you on the back, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You know, you could almost play a little brother role, if you were a bit shorter. Come on! We just need a few pictures.”</span> He brings you over to where they have set up some blankets, sleeping bags, and pillows. <span style="Color:Pink">You both are made to lie in the center of it all and act out a cute sleepover.</span> <br>
<br>
You both lie next to each other and point at the ceiling as if you are watching stars. Engage in a pillow fight that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span> takes a little too seriously. Even pretend to be asleep in rather endearing, if not slightly embarrassing, situations. <span style="Color:Pink">The most embarrassing pose they have you do is one where you are cuddled up alongside <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span>, face buried into his bare side as your arms and legs wrap around him. You can’t help but feel your groin stiffen a little just from the closeness and body heat.</span> <br>
<br>
