:: OC Leo Modeling Quest Confident [nobr]

<span style="Color:Pink">You act confident and unafraid, smirking and posing alongside <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span>. Whether you are just putting up an act or are really just confident is anyone’s guess, but it works. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span> seems amused by your confidence and ups and energy, posing and laughing alongside you as if the two of you are best friends. It leads to some rather dashing and mature poses for the both of you.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yes, yes! You two look perfect together!”</span> The producer cheers, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Your dynamic is already so clear, so pure! The dynamic duo, able to take on the world by sheer young swagger alone! I love it! It’s perfect!”</span> Both of the other two at the table nod along with the producer as he jumps to his feet. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span>, what do you think?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I think he’ll work well. We don’t have this dynamic yet and it would work well for some shoots.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span> pauses for a moment, thinking, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why don’t we try some formal poses? Get some suits and do a mock around the town? I think he’d look great in those.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span> gives you a smile as the producer claps his hands together in agreement. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color:Pink">You are then both brought out a rather fancy suit, like something you’d wear to a wedding or formal get-together. It takes you a second to get on, the item being in so many pieces, and are thankful for the clip-on tie. When you walk out of the changing room, you find <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span>’s is an exact match for yours and smile at how the matching outfits really sells the ‘best friends’ angle the shoot was going for.</span> <br>

