<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You look nice.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span> smiles, walking over and giving you a thumbs up, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That suit fits you well, I sort of guessed your sizes, but guess I did a good job.”</span> He smiles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Come on, we just need a few pictures to send to the director.”</span> He brings you over to the small photo area, where they have set up a small counter with some sparkling drinks that you quickly discover is just flat lemon-lime soda. <br>
<br>
The two of you act out a few scenes, including chatting over drinks, laughing at a hilarious joke, which <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo</span> makes easier by actually telling a funny one, and flirting with some passing girls. <span style="Color:Pink">The latter may not be something you’re really used to, going to an all-boy’s school, but manage to pick up quickly enough.</span> By the time the take the last few pictures, you actually find yourself feeling like a little model. It is a rather exciting job! Though the constant flashing lights do hurt your eyes a little. <br>
<br>
